1
00:00:00,571 --> 00:00:03,241
Hola, nerd-migos.

2
00:00:05,576 --> 00:00:07,786
(Penny:)Why do you people hate sleep?

3
00:00:08,746 --> 00:00:10,536
(Penny:)Are you wearing my robe?

4
00:00:12,041 --> 00:00:14,171
(Howard:)Oh, yeah. Sorry, I'll have it cleaned.

5
00:00:14,335 --> 00:00:16,675
(Penny:)That's okay, keep it.

6
00:00:17,421 --> 00:00:19,881
- Where's Christy?
- In the shower.

7
00:00:20,132 --> 00:00:22,382
(Howard:)By the way,
where did you get that loofah mitt?

8
00:00:22,551 --> 00:00:25,141
(Howard:)Yours reaches places
that mine just won't.

9
00:00:29,308 --> 00:00:31,518
(Penny:)You used my loofah?

10
00:00:31,686 --> 00:00:34,106
(Howard:)More precisely, we used your loofah.

11
00:00:34,271 --> 00:00:36,901
(Howard:)I exfoliated her brains out.

12
00:00:39,068 --> 00:00:40,988
(Penny:)You can keep that too.

13
00:00:41,445 --> 00:00:45,655
(Howard:)Ah. Well, then, we'll probably need to talk
about your stuffed-bear collection.

14
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:49,246
CHRISTY: Howard?
- In here, milady.

15
00:00:50,454 --> 00:00:54,084
(Christie(entering):)Mm. There's my little engine that could.

16
00:00:54,834 --> 00:00:56,834
[IMITATING TRAIN]

17
00:00:58,671 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)There's one beloved children's book
I'll never read again.

